<view class="page">
  <view class="section collection-heading"><view class="eyebrow">THE XM WARDROBE</view><view class="section-title">衣橱精选</view><view class="section-english">Selected pieces</view><view class="body-text">从一件针织开始，让舒适与风格自然相遇。</view></view>
  <view class="filter-bar"><button wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="key" class="filter {{active === item.key ? 'filter-active' : ''}}" data-filter="{{item.key}}" bindtap="filterProducts">{{item.name}}</button><text class="piece-count">{{count}} 款</text></view>
  <view class="section collection-items"><view class="product-grid"><button class="product-card" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><view class="product-cover"><image src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load/><text class="product-category">{{item.categoryText}}</text></view><view class="product-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="product-tags">{{item.tagsText}}</view><view class="product-meta">{{item.materialText}} · {{item.priceText}}</view><view class="card-colors"><text wx:for="{{item.colors}}" wx:for-item="color" wx:key="color" class="color-dot" style="background:{{color.hex}};"></text></view></button></view><view class="muted-note catalog-note">实物色彩可能因光线与屏幕略有差异，具体信息以店内实物为准。</view></view>
</view>
